    "Health Club's medical and public health editorial team conducted meticulous on-site verification to produce this authoritative operational guide. Below is a comprehensive directory of northern Feni's top 10 government and private healthcare facilities, visiting specialist doctor chamber schedules, diagnostic test price benchmarks, and verified emergency ambulance contacts connecting directly with Health Club's [Emergency Directory](/emergency).",
